#: ../../source/set-getter_README.md:21
msgid ""
"set-getter works like [set-value](https://github.com/jonschlinkert/set-"
"value) by adding a property to an object or an object hierarchy using dot"
" notation. The main difference is that the property is added using "
"`Object.defineProperty` and is expected to be a getter function that "
"returns a value."
msgstr ""

